{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12394","headline":"陪郭常侍令公东亭宴集 · 钱起","name":"陪郭常侍令公东亭宴集","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"盛业山河列，重名劒履荣。\n珥貂爲相子，开合引时英。\n美景池台色，佳期宴赏情。\n词人载笔至，仙妓出花迎。\n暗竹朱轮转，回塘玉佩鸣。\n舞衫招戏蝶，歌扇隔啼莺。\n饮德心皆醉，披云兴转清。\n不愁懽乐尽，积庆在和羹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12394.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12394","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}